WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.388
Tester: Step three, the reading pass.

2
00:00:02.388 --> 00:00:05.657
Tester: The home page from the top, in Safari with VoiceOver,

3
00:00:05.657 --> 00:00:09.049
Tester: the way someone who can't see the screen would meet it.

4
00:00:13.447 --> 00:00:16.533
VoiceOver: Skip to content visited link is in the VoiceOver cursor

5
00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:20.484
Tester: The first thing it reaches is a skip link, which is a good start.

6
00:00:20.484 --> 00:00:23.158
Tester: Now I'll read the header one item at a time.

7
