8
00:00:26.948 --> 00:00:28.608
VoiceOver: banner

9
00:00:28.608 --> 00:00:31.133
VoiceOver: visited link Marcelo Paiva

10
00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:33.309
VoiceOver: Main navigation

11
00:00:33.309 --> 00:00:35.230
VoiceOver: list 5 items

12
00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:37.609
VoiceOver: link Writing 1 of 5

13
00:00:37.609 --> 00:00:39.946
VoiceOver: link Work 2 of 5

14
00:00:39.946 --> 00:00:42.226
VoiceOver: link Signal 3 of 5

15
00:00:42.226 --> 00:00:44.555
VoiceOver: link Tools 4 of 5

16
