20
00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:57.849
Tester: Set for you… a button, and it tells me it's collapsed. That's what I want to hear.

21
00:00:57.849 --> 00:00:58.445
Tester: Next item.

22
00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:04.325
Reviewer: A name, a role, and a state. That's what WCAG 4.1.2 asks for.

23
00:01:05.052 --> 00:01:07.096
VoiceOver: menu

24
00:01:07.096 --> 00:01:12.286
VoiceOver: menu

25
00:01:12.286 --> 00:01:14.331
VoiceOver: menu

26
00:01:14.331 --> 00:01:19.268
VoiceOver: menu

27
00:01:19.268 --> 00:01:24.543
Tester: It says menu… and again… and again. Four presses, and it hasn't moved past it.

28
00:01:24.945 --> 00:01:26.573
Reviewer: There's no menu on screen.

29
00:01:26.573 --> 00:01:31.710
Reviewer: The settings panel is closed, but its four dropdowns are still reaching VoiceOver.

30
00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:35.029
Reviewer: That's a problem under WCAG 4.1.2, Name, Role, Value.

31
00:01:35.029 --> 00:01:38.600
Reviewer: If you're listening, it sounds like the page has stopped,

32
00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:41.795
Reviewer: right at the control that sets the site up for you.

33
00:01:44.395 --> 00:01:48.051
Reviewer: The fix: the panel is now left empty while it's closed.

34
00:01:48.051 --> 00:01:50.645
Reviewer: Here's the same page after that change.

35
00:01:51.046 --> 00:01:53.146
Tester: I'll go straight to Set for you.

36
00:01:53.765 --> 00:01:59.765
VoiceOver: Set for you collapsed button

37
00:02:01.359 --> 00:02:04.584
Tester: Collapsed, the same as before. Next item.

38
00:02:05.219 --> 00:02:11.034
VoiceOver: Pause motion toggle button

39
00:02:11.034 --> 00:02:15.859
Tester: That's Pause motion, the next button on the screen. The silence is gone.

40
00:02:16.261 --> 00:02:18.611
Reviewer: 4.1.2 holds here.
